        <mxCell id="legend-title" value="Issues (numbers match SOLUTION.md)" style="text;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="200" y="555" width="400" height="24" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-left" value="&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;  nginx proxies to :3001, the API listens on :3000: every /api/ call returns 502.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;  No pool.on(&#39;error&#39;): a Postgres restart crashes the API process.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;  No restart policy: a crashed container stays down.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt;  nginx resolves &quot;api&quot; once at startup: a recreated API (new IP) gets 502s." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="200" y="582" width="510" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-right" value="&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt;  ioredis queues and retries while Redis is down: requests hang over 90 s.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt;  release() skipped on query error, no pool timeout: leaked clients exhaust the pool.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt;  depends_on waits for container start only, no health checks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt;  init.sql and nginx.conf are never mounted: dead, misleading config." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="720" y="582" width="510" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
